<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico monetary aggregates to August.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico monetary aggregates to August.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico released its preliminary monetary aggregates up to August. All figures are in billions of pesos:</p>
<p>			 Jul95   Aug95   Dec95   Jul96   Aug96</p>
<p>M1		     128.5   128.5   165.4   181.2   187.9</p>
<p>Notes/coins	   43.2    43.5    60.7    55.5    55.1</p>
<p>Checking accts	85.3    85.0   104.7   125.7   132.8</p>
<p>M4		     754.4   769.5   880.1 1,005.0 1,018.0</p>
<p>Bank deposits</p>
<p>-private	     489.5   496.9   566.6   645.1   651.3</p>
<p>-development	  51.0    54.1    76.5    88.3    93.4</p>
<p>Securities</p>
<p>-government	  102.0   106.5   104.6   123.9   125.0</p>
<p>-private		27.5    26.5    23.2    21.7    21.8</p>
<p>Retirement savings  41.2    42.0    48.5    70.5    71.4</p>
<p>M1 measures notes and coints in circulation and checking accounts</p>
<p>M4 measures notes and coins in circulation as well as deposits in the banking system, holdings of private and government securities and funds in the Retirement Savings System (SAR).</p>
<p>-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9560</p>
